WEBVTT

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:02.056
so that they can appreciate
their own progress,

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:04.016
and that's when suddenly

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:08.240
they magically find the language talent
that they were missing all their lives.

00:10:09.480 --> 00:10:11.656
So if you've also tried
to learn a language

00:10:11.680 --> 00:10:14.096
and you gave up,
thinking it's too difficult

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:16.376
or you don't have the language talent,

00:10:16.400 --> 00:10:17.936
give it another try.

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:20.816
Maybe you're also
just one enjoyable method away

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:22.602
from learning that language fluently.

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:26.896
Maybe you're just one method away
from becoming a polyglot.

00:10:26.920 --> 00:10:28.136
Thank you.

00:10:28.160 --> 00:10:32.360
(Applause)